            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Пусть &lt;img class="equation_image" title="(E,D)" src="https://canvas.instructure.com/equation_images/(E%252CD)?scale=1" alt="LaTeX: (E,D)" data-equation-content="(E,D)" data-ignore-a11y-check=""&gt; – шифр подстановки на &lt;img class="equation_image" title="(K,M,C):M=C=\Sigma,K=S(\Sigma)" src="https://canvas.instructure.com/equation_images/(K%252CM%252CC)%253AM%253DC%253D%255CSigma%252CK%253DS(%255CSigma)?scale=1" alt="LaTeX: (K,M,C):M=C=\Sigma,K=S(\Sigma)" data-equation-content="(K,M,C):M=C=\Sigma,K=S(\Sigma)" data-ignore-a11y-check=""&gt; (множество подстановок на &lt;img class="equation_image" title="\Sigma" src="https://canvas.instructure.com/equation_images/%255CSigma?scale=1" alt="LaTeX: \Sigma" data-equation-content="\Sigma" data-ignore-a11y-check=""&gt; ).&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;Является ли &lt;img class="equation_image" title="(E,D)" src="https://canvas.instructure.com/equation_images/(E%252CD)?scale=1" alt="LaTeX: (E,D)" data-equation-content="(E,D)" data-ignore-a11y-check=""&gt; семантически стойким шифром? Если нет продемонстрируйте атаку с преимуществом равным 1.&lt;/p&gt;
